1
00:00:00,447 --> 00:00:03,327
(Sheldon:)...to be the lower-left corner
on Hollywood Squares.

2
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:08,914
(Sheldon:)Oh, damn! The floppy failed.

3
00:00:09,081 --> 00:00:11,501
(Sheldon:)Well, whoever was in charge
of quality control...

4
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:16,967
(Sheldon:)...at the Verbatim Corporation in 1989,
congratulations, you just made the list.

5
00:00:22,094 --> 00:00:24,764
- Howard?
- Change your mind about sex?

6
00:00:25,347 --> 00:00:27,597
(Howard:)I'm still mad but I'll do it.

7
00:00:29,059 --> 00:00:31,149
(Bernadette:)No, I've just been thinking.

8
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:35,069
(Bernadette:)It doesn't matter
if I'm afraid for your safety.

9
00:00:35,232 --> 00:00:38,572
(Bernadette:)I don't want to be the person who stands
between you and your dreams.

10
00:00:39,278 --> 00:00:41,488
- Really?
- Really.

11
00:00:41,655 --> 00:00:45,455
(Bernadette:)If going into space means that much
I will never say another word about it.

12
00:00:46,118 --> 00:00:47,698
Thank you, heh.

13
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:50,370
(Bernadette:)- I love you.
- I love you too, heh.

14
00:00:54,209 --> 00:00:55,749
(Howard:)So sex now?

15
00:00:57,629 --> 00:00:58,669
(Sheldon:)- Okay.
- Heh.

16
00:00:58,839 --> 00:01:21,039
(Bernadette:)I just forgot to brush my teeth.
I'll be right back.

